1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,900
Hi, my name is Fadly Tanjung. I'm from Indonesia. With my team, I built Kredibel.

2
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:12,751
A small business gets about a hundred documents a month: statements, invoices and receipts.

3
00:00:13,001 --> 00:00:17,651
Checking them by hand takes days, and one edited bank statement can hide fraud.

4
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:21,808
Kredibel checks a business's own books, and shows the evidence behind every number.

5
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:27,074
Upload files in any order. A copy is spotted at once, and never counted twice.

6
00:00:27,324 --> 00:00:32,862
Gemini reads every page, and code checks each value is printed where Gemini says it is.

7
00:00:33,847 --> 00:00:37,922
Each month reconciles itself, and what looks wrong comes with its evidence.

8
00:00:38,172 --> 00:00:41,202
Here, an amount was edited in a PDF editor.

9
00:00:41,961 --> 00:00:43,711
New: the loan readiness report.

10
00:00:43,961 --> 00:00:49,552
Before the owner applies for credit, Kredibel says if the books are ready to show a lender, and what to fix first.

11
00:00:49,802 --> 00:00:53,981
Every figure comes from code. Print it, or save it as a PDF.

12
00:00:55,640 --> 00:01:02,014
Built with Google AI. Gemini on Vertex AI reads every page and explains each risk.

13
00:01:02,264 --> 00:01:08,951
Document AI reads scans and receipt photos. And the Agent Development Kit runs every workflow on Cloud Run.

14
00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:13,215
Kredibel helps small businesses, their accountants, and the lenders they apply to.

15
00:01:13,465 --> 00:01:15,607
Try it at kredibel.app.
